# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
#
# NOTE: key.properties aur noor-release.p12 is repo me COMMITED hain (repo
# private hai). Reason: GitHub ka har runner apna naya debug key banata hai,
# aur debug key se sign ki hui nayi APK purani APK ke upar install hi nahi
# hoti ("signatures do not match"). Fixed release key se har release update
# hota hai. Play Store jaise public store par daalne se pehle key rotate karo.
#key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
